#: addons/privacy.php:245
msgid "This site uses Better Messages for private messaging between users. The following describes what personal data is collected, how it is used, and your rights regarding that data."
msgstr ""

#: addons/privacy.php:257
msgid "What data is collected"
msgstr ""

#: addons/privacy.php:258
msgid "When you use the messaging feature, the following data is collected and stored on this site:"
msgstr ""

#: addons/privacy.php:259
msgid "Messages you send, including text content and file attachments"
msgstr ""

#: addons/privacy.php:260
msgid "Conversation participation records (who you are in conversation with)"
msgstr ""

#: addons/privacy.php:261
msgid "Message delivery and read timestamps"
msgstr ""

#: addons/privacy.php:262
msgid "Your online status and last activity time"
msgstr ""

#: addons/privacy.php:263
msgid "Emoji reactions you add to messages"
msgstr ""

#: addons/privacy.php:270
msgid "Guest users"
msgstr ""

#: addons/privacy.php:271
msgid "If you use the messaging feature as a guest (without an account), your display name, email address (if provided), and IP address are stored to identify you within the conversation."
msgstr ""

#: addons/privacy.php:278
msgid "Browser storage"
msgstr ""

#: addons/privacy.php:279
msgid "A copy of your recent messages and conversation data is cached in your browser (IndexedDB) for faster loading. This data stays on your device and is not shared. You can clear it by clearing your browser data."
msgstr ""

#: addons/privacy.php:286
msgid "Video links (YouTube, Vimeo, etc.) may load embedded players directly from those services, which allows them to collect data about your visit."
msgstr ""

#: addons/privacy.php:290
msgid "Video links (YouTube, Vimeo, etc.) are shown as previews. The actual video loads from the third-party service only after you click to play it."
msgstr ""

#: addons/privacy.php:294
msgid "Emoji images are loaded from an external CDN (jsdelivr.net), which may receive your IP address."
msgstr ""

#: addons/privacy.php:298
msgid "GIF images are loaded directly from Giphy's servers (media.giphy.com) when displayed in messages, which may receive your IP address."
msgstr ""

#: addons/privacy.php:302
msgid "Sticker images are loaded directly from Stipop's servers (img.stipop.io) when displayed in messages, which may receive your IP address."
msgstr ""

#: addons/privacy.php:306
msgid "Group voice and video calls are routed through a cloud service to connect participants. Private one-on-one calls are established directly between users."
msgstr ""

#: addons/privacy.php:310
msgid "Real-time message delivery is handled through a cloud server (cloud.better-messages.com). Your messages are encrypted in transit and pass through this server for instant delivery."
msgstr ""

#: addons/privacy.php:320
msgid "Third-party services"
msgstr ""

#: addons/privacy.php:321
msgid "Depending on the site configuration, the following third-party services may be used:"
msgstr ""

#: addons/privacy.php:330
msgid "AI Chat Bots"
msgstr ""

#: addons/privacy.php:331
msgid "This site may use AI-powered chat bots. When you interact with an AI bot, your messages in that conversation are sent to the AI service provider (such as OpenAI, Anthropic, or Google) to generate responses."
msgstr ""

#: addons/privacy.php:338
msgid "Data retention and your rights"
msgstr ""

#: addons/privacy.php:339
msgid "Your messages are stored as long as your account is active. You can request an export of your messaging data or request deletion of your messages through the privacy tools provided by this site (Tools → Export Personal Data / Erase Personal Data). When messages are erased, the content is replaced with a placeholder to preserve conversation context for other participants."
msgstr ""

